B.amJ=new A.ld('Level of Consciousness Assessment "AVPU" card. Mapping + airway pearls drawn from APLS 6th edition (Advanced Paediatric Life Support) and the BMJ Best Practice paediatric trauma pathway. For use by qualified clinicians only.',null)
