B.amL=new A.ld("Emergency Drugs + Vasoactive Medications tables. For use by qualified clinicians only.",null)
B.amM=new A.ld("Common Poisoning and Antidotes Available card. Mnemonic + clinical notes are research add-ons (Goldfrank's Toxicologic Emergencies, 11th ed.; AAP Committee on Drugs). For use by qualified clinicians only \u2014 verify dose and route against the source guideline before administering.",null)
