B.buE=s(["The fetus is having rapid eye movements during sleep.","The average fetus at 23 weeks is 12.1 inches (30.6 cm) long and weighs 1.3 pounds (568 grams).","The entire corpus callosum may not be seen using transabdominal ultrasound before this age."],t.s)
